{"seq":2,"slug":"zustand","title":"Zustand 状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/zustand","wordCount":582,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"zustand-状态管理\">Zustand 状态管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Zustand 是一个约 1KB（gzip）的轻量级状态管理库，它用一个不带 Provider 包裹的 store 承载状态，并借 selector 实现细粒度订阅。其 API 极简、学习曲线低，action 直接定义在 store 中，无需额外的 thunk 模式。本章讲解为什么选择 Zustand、store 的创建方式、selector 与 <code>useShallow</code> 的优化、中间件系统（DevTools、持久化、Immer），以及它与 Redux 的取舍对比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-zustand\">为什么选择 Zustand</h2><p>Zustand 是一个轻量级的 React 状态管理库，API 极简，无 Provider 包裹，天然支持 selector 细粒度订阅。它的包体积仅约 1KB（gzip），远小于 Redux。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Redux&#10;        A[Action] --&gt; B[Reducer]&#10;        B --&gt; C[Store]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Provider]&#10;        D --&gt; E[useSelector]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Zustand&#10;        F[create store] --&gt; G[useStore + selector]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Redux\n        A[Action] --&gt; B[Reducer]\n        B --&gt; C[Store]\n        C --&gt; D[Provider]\n        D --&gt; E[useSelector]\n    end\n    subgraph Zustand\n        F[create store] --&gt; G[useStore + selector]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Zustand</th>\n<th>Redux Toolkit</th>\n<th>Context</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包体积</td>\n<td>~1KB</td>\n<td>~12KB</td>\n<td>0（内置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样板代码</td>\n<td>极少</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>较多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Provider</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Selector</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>useSelector</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DevTools</td>\n<td>中间件支持</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步操作</td>\n<td>直接在 action 中使用</td>\n<td>createAsyncThunk</td>\n<td>手动处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"store-创建\">Store 创建</h2><p>Zustand 使用 <code>create</code> 函数定义 store，state 和 actions 合并在一起：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { create } from &#39;zustand&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface TodoItem {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  completed: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TodoStore {&#10;  todos: TodoItem[];&#10;  filter: &#39;all&#39; | &#39;active&#39; | &#39;completed&#39;;&#10;  addTodo: (text: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  toggleTodo: (id: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  removeTodo: (id: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  setFilter: (filter: &#39;all&#39; | &#39;active&#39; | &#39;completed&#39;) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const useTodoStore = create&lt;TodoStore&gt;((set) =&gt; ({&#10;  todos: [],&#10;  filter: &#39;all&#39;,&#10;&#10;  addTodo: (text) =&gt;&#10;    set((state) =&gt; ({&#10;      todos: [...state.todos, { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, completed: false }],&#10;    })),&#10;&#10;  toggleTodo: (id) =&gt;&#10;    set((state) =&gt; ({&#10;      todos: state.todos.map((todo) =&gt; (todo.id === id ? { ...todo, completed: !todo.completed } : todo)),&#10;    })),&#10;&#10;  removeTodo: (id) =&gt;&#10;    set((state) =&gt; ({&#10;      todos: state.todos.filter((todo) =&gt; todo.id !== id),&#10;    })),&#10;&#10;  setFilter: (filter) =&gt; set({ filter }),&#10;}));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { create } from 'zustand';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface TodoItem {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  completed: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface TodoStore {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  todos: TodoItem[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter: 'all' | 'active' | 'completed';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  addTodo: (text: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  toggleTodo: (id: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  removeTodo: (id: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setFilter: (filter: 'all' | 'active' | 'completed') => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const useTodoStore = create&#x3C;TodoStore>((set) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  todos: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter: 'all',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  addTodo: (text) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set((state) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      todos: [...state.todos, { id: crypto.randomUUID(), text, completed: false }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  toggleTodo: (id) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set((state) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      todos: state.todos.map((todo) => (todo.id === id ? { ...todo, completed: !todo.completed } : todo)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  removeTodo: (id) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    set((state) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      todos: state.todos.filter((todo) => todo.id !== id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setFilter: (filter) => set({ filter }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}));</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"selectors\">Selectors</h2><p>Zustand 的核心优势之一是 <strong>selector</strong> 机制。组件只订阅需要的 state 片段，其他 state 变化不触发重渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function TodoList() {&#10;  const todos = useTodoStore((state) =&gt; state.todos);&#10;  const filter = useTodoStore((state) =&gt; state.filter);&#10;&#10;  const filteredTodos = todos.filter((todo) =&gt; {&#10;    if (filter === &#39;active&#39;) return !todo.completed;&#10;    if (filter === &#39;completed&#39;) return todo.completed;&#10;    return true;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ul&gt;&#10;      {filteredTodos.map((todo) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;TodoItem key={todo.id} todo={todo} /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function TodoCount() {&#10;  const count = useTodoStore((state) =&gt; state.todos.length);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;{count} 项&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const todos = useTodoStore((state) => state.todos);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const filter = useTodoStore((state) => state.filter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const filteredTodos = todos.filter((todo) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (filter === 'active') return !todo.completed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (filter === 'completed') return todo.completed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {filteredTodos.map((todo) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;TodoItem key={todo.id} todo={todo} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoCount() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const count = useTodoStore((state) => state.todos.length);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>{count} 项&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于返回新对象的 selector，使用 <code>shallow</code> 比较避免不必要的重渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useShallow } from &#39;zustand/react/shallow&#39;;&#10;&#10;function TodoStats() {&#10;  const { total, active, completed } = useTodoStore(&#10;    useShallow((state) =&gt; ({&#10;      total: state.todos.length,&#10;      active: state.todos.filter((t) =&gt; !t.completed).length,&#10;      completed: state.todos.filter((t) =&gt; t.completed).length,&#10;    })),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      总计: {total} | 进行中: {active} | 已完成: {completed}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useShallow } from 'zustand/react/shallow';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoStats() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { total, active, completed } = useTodoStore(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    useShallow((state) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      total: state.todos.length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      active: state.todos.filter((t) => !t.completed).length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      completed: state.todos.filter((t) => t.completed).length,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      总计: {total} | 进行中: {active} | 已完成: {completed}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"middleware\">Middleware</h2><p>Zustand 通过中间件扩展功能。常用中间件包括持久化、日志、Immer 等：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { create } from &#39;zustand&#39;;&#10;import { devtools, persist } from &#39;zustand/middleware&#39;;&#10;import { immer } from &#39;zustand/middleware/immer&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface AppStore {&#10;  count: number;&#10;  increment: () =&gt; void;&#10;  decrement: () =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const useAppStore = create&lt;AppStore&gt;()(&#10;  devtools(&#10;    persist(&#10;      immer((set) =&gt; ({&#10;        count: 0,&#10;        increment: () =&gt;&#10;          set((state) =&gt; {&#10;            state.count += 1;&#10;          }),&#10;        decrement: () =&gt;&#10;          set((state) =&gt; {&#10;            state.count -= 1;&#10;          }),&#10;      })),&#10;      { name: &#39;app-store&#39; },&#10;    ),&#10;    { name: &#39;AppStore&#39; },&#10;  ),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { create } from 'zustand';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { devtools, persist } from 'zustand/middleware';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { immer } from 'zustand/middleware/immer';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface AppStore {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  increment: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decrement: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const useAppStore = create&#x3C;AppStore>()(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  devtools(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    persist(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      immer((set) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        count: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        increment: () =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          set((state) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        decrement: () =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          set((state) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            state.count -= 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      { name: 'app-store' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { name: 'AppStore' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Action 调用] --&gt; B[Immer: 可变写法]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Persist: 同步到 localStorage]&#10;    C --&gt; D[DevTools: 记录到 Redux DevTools]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Store 更新]&#10;    E --&gt; F[通知订阅的组件]\">flowchart LR\n    A[Action 调用] --&gt; B[Immer: 可变写法]\n    B --&gt; C[Persist: 同步到 localStorage]\n    C --&gt; D[DevTools: 记录到 Redux DevTools]\n    D --&gt; E[Store 更新]\n    E --&gt; F[通知订阅的组件]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中间件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>引入方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>devtools</code></td>\n<td>连接 Redux DevTools</td>\n<td><code>zustand/middleware</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>persist</code></td>\n<td>持久化到 localStorage</td>\n<td><code>zustand/middleware</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>immer</code></td>\n<td>可变写法更新不可变数据</td>\n<td><code>zustand/middleware/immer</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>subscribeWithSelector</code></td>\n<td>外部订阅时使用 selector</td>\n<td><code>zustand/middleware</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"devtools\">DevTools</h2><p>通过 <code>devtools</code> 中间件可以在 Redux DevTools 中查看 Zustand store 的状态变化。给 action 添加名称便于调试：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const useStore = create&lt;Store&gt;()(&#10;  devtools(&#10;    (set) =&gt; ({&#10;      count: 0,&#10;      increment: () =&gt; set((state) =&gt; ({ count: state.count + 1 }), false, &#39;increment&#39;),&#10;      decrement: () =&gt; set((state) =&gt; ({ count: state.count - 1 }), false, &#39;decrement&#39;),&#10;    }),&#10;    { name: &#39;MyStore&#39;, enabled: process.env.NODE_ENV === &#39;development&#39; },&#10;  ),&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const useStore = create&#x3C;Store>()(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  devtools(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (set) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      count: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      increment: () => set((state) => ({ count: state.count + 1 }), false, 'increment'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      decrement: () => set((state) => ({ count: state.count - 1 }), false, 'decrement'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    { name: 'MyStore', enabled: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development' },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>set</code> 的第三个参数是 action name，会显示在 DevTools 的 action 列表中，强烈建议为每个 action 命名以方便调试。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与-redux-的对比\">与 Redux 的对比</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// Redux Toolkit&#10;const counterSlice = createSlice({&#10;  name: &#39;counter&#39;,&#10;  initialState: { value: 0 },&#10;  reducers: {&#10;    increment: (state) =&gt; {&#10;      state.value += 1;&#10;    },&#10;    decrement: (state) =&gt; {&#10;      state.value -= 1;&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// Zustand&#10;const useCounterStore = create&lt;CounterStore&gt;((set) =&gt; ({&#10;  value: 0,&#10;  increment: () =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({ value: s.value + 1 })),&#10;  decrement: () =&gt; set((s) =&gt; ({ value: s.value - 1 })),&#10;}));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Redux Toolkit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const counterSlice = createSlice({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'counter',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  initialState: { value: 0 },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reducers: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    increment: (state) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state.value += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    decrement: (state) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      state.value -= 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Zustand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const useCounterStore = create&#x3C;CounterStore>((set) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  value: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  increment: () => set((s) => ({ value: s.value + 1 })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  decrement: () => set((s) => ({ value: s.value - 1 })),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}));</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Zustand</th>\n<th>Redux Toolkit</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异步操作</td>\n<td>直接 async/await</td>\n<td>createAsyncThunk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>少</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态系统</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>丰富</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>小到大</td>\n<td>中到大</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Zustand 是轻量级状态管理库，API 极简，无需 Provider</li>\n<li><strong>Selector</strong> 机制实现细粒度订阅，配合 <code>useShallow</code> 优化对象返回值</li>\n<li>中间件系统支持 DevTools、持久化、Immer 等扩展</li>\n<li>与 Redux 相比代码量更少、学习曲线更低，适合中小型到大型项目</li>\n<li>Action 直接定义在 store 中，支持 async/await，无需额外的 thunk 模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Zustand 状态管理","id":"zustand-状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么选择 Zustand","id":"为什么选择-zustand"},{"level":2,"text":"Store 创建","id":"store-创建"},{"level":2,"text":"Selectors","id":"selectors"},{"level":2,"text":"Middleware","id":"middleware"},{"level":2,"text":"DevTools","id":"devtools"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Redux 的对比","id":"与-redux-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Context 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/context-patterns"},"next":{"title":"Redux Toolkit 状态管理工具集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/redux-toolkit"}}